msgstr "PayKassa для WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: paykassa.php
msgid "Modern crypto payments for WooCommerce through PayKassa."
msgstr "Современные криптоплатежи для WooCommerce через PayKassa."

#. Author of the plugin
